    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="default-lt" TIER_ID="default"/>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="imported-sep" TIER_ID="SPEAKER_00">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts4">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In what ways do you feel oh I love this question in what ways do you feel you are the continuation of me?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a3"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts15" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts17">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[music]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a4"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts18" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts20">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When was the moment you knew that you could trust me and really open up?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a9"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts32" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts57">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, and if I could answer that back, that question. So, when I was your mother, and you were, I'm going to say under 18, okay, I felt so responsible for you like this is a human life I am responsible for. And I was so on edge about that.. I felt so anxious about it. Like, am I doing the right thing? And so I was constantly trying to fix things and do things. And I felt like I couldn't share a lot of that with you because I just had to put on this mother facade. You know, I'm your mother. As soon as you got into college and especially out of college and started making your own way in the world, I just felt this huge release of responsibility. And I could just be me. I still feel, even now, I still feel like, okay, I'm her mom. There's certain things I'm not going to share. But I feel like as time goes on, that lessens you know?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a15"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts65" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts72">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, so. I'm a little hesitant to talk to you about why it was so hard for me to parent you when you were little. I feel like when I go there, like the night at Miru.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a16"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts73" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts80">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Um, I'm gonna hurt your feelings. I'm gonna make you feel bad. So, and I was being really vulnerable that night. So I wasn't thinking about what I was saying, I was just talking.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a17"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts82" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts86">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then I felt so bad when you told me that it kind of hurt your feelings. So I am hesitant to really be honest with you about what it was like for me when you were small.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a18"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts89" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts90">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I just felt like I wasn't doing anything right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a19"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts91" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts94">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So that was really hard. Yeah. It was really, really hard. And I think I made</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a20"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts95" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts96">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Instead of listening to my own instincts and gut feeling,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a21"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts97" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts98">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Which was hard to do because I didn't have a strong mother figure, so I didn't have</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a390"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts102" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts103">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a22"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts107" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts112">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right. So I and I'm I'm so much of a fixer that I just decided to turn to professionals. But the fact that I turned to professionals, we made a lot of bad decisions.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a392"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts118" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts119">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a393"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts120" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts121">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a394"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts122" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts123">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I'm gonna be like</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a27"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts126" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts132">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. Yeah, exactly.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a28"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts136" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts138">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, what's something I still don't fully understand about you and why do you think that is?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a397"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts154" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts155">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Different generations.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a36"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts163" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts168">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. Can I just answer my way? Okay, answer the question this way. One thing I still don't fully understand is why at such a young age you started gravitating to the black community. That will always be a curious thing for me. I almost feel like it was meant to be, like it was part of your journey.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a400"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts174" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts175">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was, it was, I remember you didn't want to go to school one day.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a401"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts176" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts177">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a41"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts180" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts186">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I wasn't. So think about it. You were born to a mother who totally kind of fit the mold.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a402"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts188" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts189">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was white.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a44"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts190" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts206">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We know. I didn't have to worry. Then I was exposed through you to this concept of I need to find my people. And my people aren't your people. It's like this tribal thing, kind of. [yeah, no it's true] And it was so scary for me and for dad.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a407"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts208" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts209">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was scared.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a408"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts212" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts213">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It blessed, it was, blessed.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a409"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts214" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts215">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mm-mmh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a410"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts222" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts223">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>True. True.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a411"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts224" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts225">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>True.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a52"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts228" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts232">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I made assumptions. For sure.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a303"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts241" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts243">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What am I?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a413"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts246" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts249">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh when am I concerned ?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a55"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts253" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts254">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Humm. When you call me and you're really sad.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a56"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts256" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts258">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you'll say, I'm so lonely. I feel so alone.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a57"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts260" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts264">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It used to be when you had panic attacks, but now luckily that's not happening anymore. But now it's more, you know, I feel so alone and I feel so sad. Humm.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a58"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts266" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts268">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's not really worry though, it's more that I want to fix it. I want to do something to take away your sadness.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a59"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts271" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts274">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That for any parent, it's really hard, no matter how old your child is.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a60"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts279" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts283">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Just to feel you can't take away pain or help them in some way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a416"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts286" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts287">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a61"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts290" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts301">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, that's what I have to remember because sometimes I'll start saying, well, call this person do that, do this, then you go, mom. You go mom, take a breath. Just listen. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a65"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts307" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts317">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. That's a really good lesson for me. So while I'm helping you, I'm learning something.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a66"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts325" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts328">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh okay. What's the pain in me you wish you could heal and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a424"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts338" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts340">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mm-mmh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a310"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts363" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts364">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was just going to say, I didn't have that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a315"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts400" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts402">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh gosh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a81"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts406" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts412">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Just in the last five years, I've noticed that you kind of take care of me and I part of me doesn't like it because I feel like, oh my God, like how does she see me as like an old woman? She's gotta help me cross the street or she's gotta help me with my bags or she's gotta help me. You know, sometimes I feel like wait.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a82"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts414" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts421">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But honestly, I actually really love it. Because I just feel taken care of. I feel like you just would do anything for me. That's what your love feels like. Like you would be there for me no matter what. And it's something I'm so grateful for that I feel sorry for my friends that don't have that, but their daughters or sons. Because it's just an awesome feeling to feel that from your adult child. That no matter what happens to me, I'll never be alone. So many people when they get older are alone. I'll never be alone. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a429"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts424" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts425">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know, I know</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a84"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts429" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts431">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Can I have that writing?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a85"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts434" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts439">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, but it is. It's the best feeling, Dan. It really is.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a432"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts450" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts451">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a433"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts452" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts453">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a319"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts456" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts458">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Is that ever really going to happen?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a434"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts462" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts463">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Maybe.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a435"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts464" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts465">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a91"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts468" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts472">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You'll be the only one that [laugh] will be allowed to do that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a92"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts476" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts479">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, here's my last. Okay, in what ways do you feel? Oh, I love this question. In what ways do you feel you are the continuation of me?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a436"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts488" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts489">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a438"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts495" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts497">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Dan, it's so sweet.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a325"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts504" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts508">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I feel that too. For you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a441"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts512" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts513">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's awesome, love that</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a442"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts514" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts515">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Love you</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a443"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts518" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts519">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know [laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a327"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts522" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts525">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I know, you're my favorite too</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
