            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a405"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts201">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a406"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts202" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts203">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah no it's true.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a340"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts204" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts218">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, it was just like very unknown for you. But I still, I don't know, I I give you both a lot of credit because even at the time, as a kid, I gave you a hard time because you wouldn't let me, you know, go to certain neighborhoods because you felt it was unsafe. I still do think to a certain degree you allowed me to explore. And I think for me, my experience, I would have been such a different human if I stayed in white wealthy neighborhoods. I think that even my friends, like, they just are in awe of me a lot of the empathy I have and the view of the world, how cultured I am, because I have friends literally from all over the world. But I mean, I feel like my life experience, my childhood experience, was a blessing for you too because it completely opened your eyes. And, like, you're so empathetic now to people of all different backgrounds. And like, that's such a beautiful thing because there are so many people in your position, racially, financially, that would not even give a second thought to a person of color and what they go through, or an impoverished person, or an oppressed person.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a341"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts221" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts227">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you don't know people in these communities, you don't know what is actually going on and that's the problem.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a412"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts230" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts231">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a342"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts237" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts238">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What are you most concerned for me and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a343"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts242" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts248">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When are you most concerned for me and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a414"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts262" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts263">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a415"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts275" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts276">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
