            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a428"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts418" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts419">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a360"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts420" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts427">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You'll never be alone. Ever. You're moving in with me, girlfriends. Literally</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a430"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts430" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts433">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes. [laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a431"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts436" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts437">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a361"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts441" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts446">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And just because I really want you to hear this, the reason I take care of you the way I do has absolutely nothing to do with your age and your ability in any way. It has to do with, I think, kind of what I was talking about earlier, where I, the older I get, the more clearly I see you. And I feel so grateful and almost like not indebted, because that's like the wrong word, but something like that, to you and dad for just all you've done for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a362"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts449" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts455">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, I always want to go above and beyond for you and dad. It has nothing to do with your age. Trust me, I don't view you like that yet. Once you get 80, 90, and I start bathing you, then you can be like, oh my God, she's bathing me. Like, I can't bathe myself anymore.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a363"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts461" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts467">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I I don't think so, but if it does, I will bathe you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a437"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts470" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts471">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a364"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts481" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts483">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, I love that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a365"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts487" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts491">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's a great question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a366"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts493" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts494">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I hope to be the continuation of you. Like, I feel honored and privileged to be the continuation of you. I feel like just the way I view you, the way I see you, your beauty and power in this world, if we had more people like you in this world, our world would be a better place.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a367"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts496" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts499">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I hope to carry on your your optimism and your love and your vivacious energy, your enthusiasm for life and living life to the fullest, and being so open-minded to where life can take you, and trying new things, and being an adventurer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a368"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts501" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts502">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I feel so proud to be your daughter. I feel so lucky that you're my mom. I feel like it's not fair. Like, I feel like, why can't everyone have a Kate Carbonari? Like, it's not fair.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a440"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts506" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts507">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a369"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts511" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts521">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I just, yeah, I feel honored to carry on your legacy. I really do. And I'm going to make you proud always. I love you. [love you] So much. You're my favorite person in the world don't tell [inaudible] or dad. [laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="default-lt" TIER_ID="SPEAKER_02">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a374"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts527" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts528">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If you enjoyed that conversation at the end, visit theskindeep.com slash shop, where you'll find more of our products to create the space to explore the relationships that are most important to you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
